{"id":"6cd0133ac0d843a2","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-identity-universal-compat.md","title":"对角限制的历史入口","display":"thm-identity-elimination — 对角限制的历史入口","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-thm-identity-universal-compat","aliases":["16-thm-identity-universal-compat","16-thm--identity-universal"],"display":"thm-identity-elimination — 对角限制的历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-thm-identity-universal]]"],"review_status":"proved-from-source-rules","review_priority":"P2","review_note_id":"J07","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.4, p. 681 (PDF 701), beta/eta conversions","review_scope":"Compatibility statement for the diagonal restriction bijection","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-identity-universal-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-identity-universal-compat</span><span>16-thm--identity-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-identity-elimination — 对角限制的历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" href=\"?note=4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" title=\"16-thm-identity-universal\">16-thm-identity-universal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"proved-from-source-rules"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P2"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J07"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.4, p. 681 (PDF 701), beta/eta conversions"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Compatibility statement for the diagonal restriction bijection"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi,C,U_C,D_C,\\rho_C,\\epsilon_C\">\\(\\Xi,C,U_C,D_C,\\rho_C,\\epsilon_C\\)</span> 及所选相等强度完全采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" href=\"?note=4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" title=\"16-thm-identity-universal\">16-thm-identity-universal</a> 的定义和侧条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\bigl(\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\bigl(\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源与证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" href=\"?note=4ba8845a1d7f7c05\" title=\"16-thm-identity-universal\">16-thm-identity-universal</a>：§11.4，p. 681（PDF 701）。此入口沿用同一转换类双射，既不另造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_d\">\\(J_d\\)</span>，也不声称原始表达式严格唯一。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-identity-universal","status":"resolved","id":"4ba8845a1d7f7c05","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-identity-universal]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-identity-universal","status":"resolved","id":"4ba8845a1d7f7c05","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Xi,C,U_C,D_C,\\rho_C,\\epsilon_C$ 及所选相等强度完全采用 [[16-thm-identity-universal]] 的定义和侧条件。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-identity-universal","status":"resolved","id":"4ba8845a1d7f7c05","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源与证明见 [[16-thm-identity-universal]]：§11.4，p. 681（PDF 701）。此入口沿用同一转换类双射，既不另造 $J_d$，也不声称原始表达式严格唯一。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Xi,C,U_C,D_C,\\rho_C,\\epsilon_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}\\ \\land\\\n\\bigl(\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"J_d","display":false}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-identity-universal-compat|thm-identity-elimination — 对角限制的历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["4ba8845a1d7f7c05"]}